---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Panel from '../components/Panel.astro';
import Blinkies from '../components/Blinkies.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site';
---

<Base title="about" description="Who I am and what's on this site.">
  <Panel title="about" note="◈ ◈ ◈">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Hello. I'm a second-year physics student. My interests sit in condensed matter and
        quantum information — I lean theoretical, though I haven't written off the
        experimental side. Topological phases, quantum error correction, and the places
        where those two meet are what's occupying me at the moment.
      </p>
      <p>
        In my spare time I write Rust. Usually projects that start with "what would I learn
        if I built this from scratch?" — a quantum circuit simulator, an N-body gravity
        integrator, a ray tracer that follows light around a black hole.
      </p>

      <p>
        Away from all that I'm learning the violin, which has been a useful lesson in being
        bad at something on purpose.
      </p>

      <h2>What's here</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/notes/">notes</a> — physics written up properly: derivations, intuition, dead ends</li>
        <li><a href="/projects/">projects</a> — what I've built and what it taught me</li>
        <li><a href="/reading/">reading</a> — books, with reviews rather than star ratings</li>
        <li><a href="/practice/">practice</a> — violin and whatever else I'm learning</li>
        <li><a href="/journal/">journal</a> — everything that doesn't fit the others</li>
        <li><a href="/uses/">uses</a> — the desk, the machine, the software</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>This site</h2>
      <p>
        Built by hand with Astro. No template, no theme, no cookies, no tracking, no ads.
        Posts live as plain Markdown files; equations are typeset with KaTeX. There's an
        <a href="/rss.xml">RSS feed</a>, because a feed reader is still the best thing the
        web ever produced.
      </p>
      <p>
        The design is a nod to old personal pages — dark, red, beveled, with a marquee and
        a hit counter that counts nothing. Best viewed with the lights off.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a> ·
        <a href={SITE.github}>github/sabfodel</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    <hr />
    <Blinkies />
  </Panel>
</Base>
